	itty stand-up comedy. Known for his clever observations and engaging stage
	 presence\, Sam Miller delivers laughs that resonate with audiences everyw
	here. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (D
	oors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Me
	morial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket
	 Prices: $20 – $24 \nAbout Sam Miller\nSam Miller is a nationally touring 
	stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit\, clever wordplay\, and relatabl
	e humor. He has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country
	\, building a dedicated following with his intelligent\, laugh-out-loud st
	yle. Sam’s comedy draws from everyday life experiences\, delivering observ
	ations that are both insightful and hilarious. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\,
	 witty stand-up comedy with clever observations\nRelatable humor that conn
	ects with audiences of all ages\nEngaging storytelling and quick-fire joke
	s\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Loony Bin Tulsa\nFull bar and dining
	 available during the show\n\nVenue Information\nLoony Bin Comedy Club Tul
	sa is located at 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133. The int
	imate venue features no seat more than 50 feet from the stage\, a full bar
	\, and a complete dining menu for an all-inclusive comedy night out. \nTic
	ket Information\nTickets for Sam Miller at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa are
	 priced at $20 – $24. Purchase directly through the Loony Bin website or f
