UID:0PPui3v_4EQOKNiHWFgtK
SUMMARY:Beat the Back to School Blues: Art Jam
DTSTAMP:20260817T033548Z
DTSTART:20260820T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:How have your first few weeks of school been going? Missed one 
