DESCRIPTION:« All Events\n 				\n				\n				\n				\n					This event has pass
	ed. \n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	Sunday Brunch				\n				\n				\n				\
	n					\n		\n			August 16\n\n	\n\n	  @  \n\n\n2:00 PM\n\n		\n\n\n\n	\n	  - 
	 \n\n4:00 PM\n\n\n\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n	\n				\n				\n				\
	n				\n									Make Sunday your favorite day of the week with brunch\, li
	ve music\, handcrafted cocktails\, and patio vibes at 1942 On The Square! 
	Join us for an afternoon of great food and live entertainment featuring Ze
	ke Potter\, live at 2 PM. As a featured participant in Black Restaurant We
	ek\, it’s the perfect time to gather with friends\, support local\, and ex
	perience the best of the Southside. Your Sunday Includes Live Music by Zek
	e Potter — 2 PMBrunch FavoritesSignature Cocktails & MimosasAugust Tequila
	 Feature: $5 Teremana Blanco or Reposado Shots\, $10 Teremana Margaritas  
	Patio Dining • Great Food • Great Music • Great Vibes 								\n				\n				
	\n				\n									\n					\n						\n									Learn More\n					\n					\n				\
